<title>HUNGARY: HUNGARY MARCH JOBLESS RATE 11 PCT, DOWN 0.1 MO/MO.</title>
<headline>HUNGARY MARCH JOBLESS RATE 11 PCT, DOWN 0.1 MO/MO.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's unemployment rate fell to 11 percent in March from 11.1 percent in February, the Labour Ministry said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The unemployment rate in March 1996 was 11.6 percent, the Ministry said in a statement.</p>
<p> HUNGARY JOBLESS	   March 97    Feb 97	March 96</p>
<p> registered unemployed  493,300	498,080	528,367</p>
<p> rate (pct)		  11.0	  11.1	   11.6</p>
<p>Note: - All percentage figures are based on size of active</p>
<p>population in January 1996.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
</text>
